status GREEN -- cold open 237 green, 0 red, 2 gated (%5), tree_moved=no, run_verdict=ok, the first spotless open this tree has read in days; hot close over the staged tree named in the commit body, run after the exec_bit repair rather than before it. QA A 96 on the paper at Field, A 92 on the probe's comments. The probe exercised on a named guard and its refusals shown on metal.
recommend keep-going -- rebuild convergence_census as a resident reader and measure it; 34,593 processes in 138 seconds is the roster's process champion, and under 3x kills the pattern where over 3x seats it.
